{"4123300": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Heartlands", "steam_appid": 4123300, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Heartlands is a multiplayer pixel sandbox where players create EVERYTHING.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Draw a sword, block, skin, instrument, NPC, or mount inside Heartlands! Press &quot;SAVE&quot;, and your creation becomes part of a live multiplayer world where other players can immediately discover and use it. Build realms, explore community creations, and help create a world where everything comes from the players!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🎨 Built-In Pixel Editor</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design everything right inside the game! Blocks, skins, wallpapers, sound effects, ladders, liquids, emojis &amp; more! Create animations frame by frame, paint pixels freely, and edit your creations at any time. Place creations into the world to design the game world with other players!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4123300/extras/0281c4fcfdc4dd3ed77187924d922e2a.avif?t=1784123682\" width=1280 height=720 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >💬 Make Your Own Skins!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make and wear your own skins. Show off your style and creativity — or your sense of humor — with several skin states to choose from: Stand, Run, Jump, Double Jump, Crouch, Dash, Wall Slide &amp; More!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4123300/extras/bb5b6643b63ffeb759f3cacf58f4b568.avif?t=1784123682\" width=435 height=218 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >💬 Online Multiplayer</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chat, build, and explore together in a shared online world. All creations are live — what one player builds, others can instantly see.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4123300/extras/70f6ffe020f6bba1d82d4396cd1703b6.avif?t=1784123682\" width=459 height=301 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🗺 Exploration &amp; Warps</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set personal warps to quickly return to your favorite builds or hidden corners of the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4123300/extras/875ecfd3015c5fd00c45b3d53b1b31db.poster.avif?t=1784123682\" width=476 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4123300/extras/875ecfd3015c5fd00c45b3d53b1b31db.webm?t=1784123682\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4123300/extras/875ecfd3015c5fd00c45b3d53b1b31db.mp4?t=1784123682\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🪦Adventure Awaits</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a world that is as safe or deadly as you want! Every realm is a world created by the player and could be filled with unexpected surprises!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4123300/extras/e1b119423954e96f68bdd5e5af5af9a2.poster.avif?t=1784123682\" width=810 height=494 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4123300/extras/e1b119423954e96f68bdd5e5af5af9a2.webm?t=1784123682\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4123300/extras/e1b119423954e96f68bdd5e5af5af9a2.mp4?t=1784123682\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >💡Lighting Mechanics</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Light up your world with Light Creations! Players create the graphic, light colors and intensity!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4123300/extras/fc1c3958cc737fba6a1253703c58c6fb.poster.avif?t=1784123682\" width=432 height=316 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4123300/extras/fc1c3958cc737fba6a1253703c58c6fb.webm?t=1784123682\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4123300/extras/fc1c3958cc737fba6a1253703c58c6fb.mp4?t=1784123682\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🎸 Instruments</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your own instruments with sound effects you design for other players to use and enjoy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4123300/extras/2c3915ef917c49fc215814bd89db3123.avif?t=1784123682\" width=472 height=266 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🔉 Sound Editor</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Import and manage your own sound effects! Change your skins jump and walk sounds to make it truly unique.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4123300/extras/bfb98a26e1fe39fa8dfbb72d7762f186.avif?t=1784123682\" width=472 height=266 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >⭐ More Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 🧰 <strong>Creation Menu &amp; Collection System:</strong> Manage all your custom creations from one place. Collect creations you find in the world and add them to your 50-slot inventory to use later.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 🪜 <strong>Layered Building System:</strong> Place blocks across <strong>four layers</strong> (Far Back, Back, Main, Front) to build with depth — from detailed backgrounds to intricate structures.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 🌐 <strong>Player Owned Realms:</strong> Go even further by owning and managing your own realm! A world where you control the ruleset and limits of what other players can do.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > ⭐ <strong>Voting &amp; Profiles:</strong> Like other players' creations to show appreciation. Browse player profiles to see their stats and recent designs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⚔️<strong>Weapons &amp; Combat:</strong> Land devastating blows with a hand drawn weapon that you created!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🦅<strong>Mounts:</strong> Players make and share ridable and flyable mounts!</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Heartlands is a multiplayer pixel sandbox where players create EVERYTHING.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Draw a sword, block, skin, instrument, NPC, or mount inside Heartlands! Press &quot;SAVE&quot;, and your creation becomes part of a live multiplayer world where other players can immediately discover and use it. Build realms, explore community creations, and help create a world where everything comes from the players!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🎨 Built-In Pixel Editor</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design everything right inside the game! Blocks, skins, wallpapers, sound effects, ladders, liquids, emojis &amp; more! Create animations frame by frame, paint pixels freely, and edit your creations at any time. Place creations into the world to design the game world with other players!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4123300/extras/0281c4fcfdc4dd3ed77187924d922e2a.avif?t=1784123682\" width=1280 height=720 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >💬 Make Your Own Skins!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make and wear your own skins. Show off your style and creativity — or your sense of humor — with several skin states to choose from: Stand, Run, Jump, Double Jump, Crouch, Dash, Wall Slide &amp; More!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4123300/extras/bb5b6643b63ffeb759f3cacf58f4b568.avif?t=1784123682\" width=435 height=218 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >💬 Online Multiplayer</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chat, build, and explore together in a shared online world. All creations are live — what one player builds, others can instantly see.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4123300/extras/70f6ffe020f6bba1d82d4396cd1703b6.avif?t=1784123682\" width=459 height=301 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🗺 Exploration &amp; Warps</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set personal warps to quickly return to your favorite builds or hidden corners of the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4123300/extras/875ecfd3015c5fd00c45b3d53b1b31db.poster.avif?t=1784123682\" width=476 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4123300/extras/875ecfd3015c5fd00c45b3d53b1b31db.webm?t=1784123682\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4123300/extras/875ecfd3015c5fd00c45b3d53b1b31db.mp4?t=1784123682\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🪦Adventure Awaits</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a world that is as safe or deadly as you want! Every realm is a world created by the player and could be filled with unexpected surprises!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4123300/extras/e1b119423954e96f68bdd5e5af5af9a2.poster.avif?t=1784123682\" width=810 height=494 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4123300/extras/e1b119423954e96f68bdd5e5af5af9a2.webm?t=1784123682\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4123300/extras/e1b119423954e96f68bdd5e5af5af9a2.mp4?t=1784123682\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >💡Lighting Mechanics</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Light up your world with Light Creations! Players create the graphic, light colors and intensity!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4123300/extras/fc1c3958cc737fba6a1253703c58c6fb.poster.avif?t=1784123682\" width=432 height=316 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4123300/extras/fc1c3958cc737fba6a1253703c58c6fb.webm?t=1784123682\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4123300/extras/fc1c3958cc737fba6a1253703c58c6fb.mp4?t=1784123682\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🎸 Instruments</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your own instruments with sound effects you design for other players to use and enjoy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4123300/extras/2c3915ef917c49fc215814bd89db3123.avif?t=1784123682\" width=472 height=266 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🔉 Sound Editor</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Import and manage your own sound effects! Change your skins jump and walk sounds to make it truly unique.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4123300/extras/bfb98a26e1fe39fa8dfbb72d7762f186.avif?t=1784123682\" width=472 height=266 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >⭐ More Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 🧰 <strong>Creation Menu &amp; Collection System:</strong> Manage all your custom creations from one place. Collect creations you find in the world and add them to your 50-slot inventory to use later.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 🪜 <strong>Layered Building System:</strong> Place blocks across <strong>four layers</strong> (Far Back, Back, Main, Front) to build with depth — from detailed backgrounds to intricate structures.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 🌐 <strong>Player Owned Realms:</strong> Go even further by owning and managing your own realm! A world where you control the ruleset and limits of what other players can do.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > ⭐ <strong>Voting &amp; Profiles:</strong> Like other players' creations to show appreciation. Browse player profiles to see their stats and recent designs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⚔️<strong>Weapons &amp; Combat:</strong> Land devastating blows with a hand drawn weapon that you created!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🦅<strong>Mounts:</strong> Players make and share ridable and flyable mounts!</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "A multiplayer sandbox where players create EVERYTHING. Design blocks, skins, sound effects, NPCs, and more! Place your creations in a live online world where every creation is player-made.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4123300/7614f96e29d10dbde8b10eec75933ff14f2813f2/header.jpg?t=1784123682", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4123300/b258df272100b86471cf58527e8e7793712b670a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1784123682", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4123300/b258df272100b86471cf58527e8e7793712b670a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1784123682", "website": "https://playheartlands.com", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 32-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-4130, AMD FX-4300, or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel HD Graphics 4600, AMD Radeon R5, or equivalent with DirectX 11 support<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 500 MB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 or Windows 11 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-6500, AMD Ryzen 3 1200, or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 750 Ti, AMD Radeon R7 360, or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Higher resolutions, shaders, and complex player creations benefit from stronger hardware.</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "ext_user_account_notice": "Heartlands Account (Supports Linking to Steam Account)", "developers": ["Wizirdi", "https://wizirdi.com"], "publishers"